WEBVTT

00:11.018 --> 00:14.438
KIRINOSHIMA JUNIOR HIGH SCHOOL

00:16.898 --> 00:18.233
Yo! Yo, Koyuki.

00:22.279 --> 00:23.113
Hey.

00:23.196 --> 00:24.823
Which one of us do you think is the
hottest?

00:24.906 --> 00:25.741
It's me, right?

00:26.408 --> 00:28.118
Huh? Well, um…

00:30.328 --> 00:31.705
Man, you're so cute.

00:32.706 --> 00:34.833
You got her all flustered, Tatsu.

00:34.916 --> 00:35.834
Look at that!

00:36.710 --> 00:38.795
They only mess with you because
you let them.

00:38.879 --> 00:40.380
Stop letting them rile you up!

00:40.881 --> 00:42.174
Oh… O-Okay.

00:44.301 --> 00:45.260
That looks so good.

00:46.344 --> 00:47.763
Ah, my bad, Koyuki.

00:47.846 --> 00:48.972
Didn't notice you there.

00:49.056 --> 00:50.682
Maybe you shouldn't be so short.

00:52.726 --> 00:53.560
Help out, Amano.

00:53.643 --> 00:55.812
Let shorty here borrow some of your
height!

00:57.439 --> 00:58.774
Could he be any more obvious?

00:58.857 --> 01:00.442
Yeah, everyone can tell.

01:00.525 --> 01:01.359
Right?

01:03.320 --> 01:04.279
Shorty, shorty!

01:04.362 --> 01:05.697
Wait up, Shorty Yuki!

01:07.449 --> 01:08.867
Chill, I was just joking!

01:09.868 --> 01:11.411
I've always asked myself…

01:11.912 --> 01:14.998
Ooh, Igarashi definitely has a crush
on you, Koyuki.

01:15.499 --> 01:17.793
I think Tatsu has a thing for you too.

01:17.876 --> 01:19.920
Ugh, lucky! I'm so jealous!

01:20.587 --> 01:24.257
Why's it alright just 'cause someone
likes you, or claims they're joking?

01:35.560 --> 01:37.938
Why don't… my feelings matter?

01:46.404 --> 01:48.031
MEITEN HIGH SCHOOL

01:48.115 --> 01:50.408
Mari, Muko, and Mei!

01:52.077 --> 01:53.245
Okay! Then everyone's in!

01:53.328 --> 01:54.162
It's happening!

01:54.246 --> 01:57.124
Last day of finals, we're having
ourselves a snack party!

01:57.707 --> 01:58.542
- Yay!
- Yay!

01:58.625 --> 01:59.459
Yay!

02:00.210 --> 02:01.837
- Love it!
- What should we bring?

02:01.920 --> 02:04.881
- Girl, this was such a great idea!
- Class Five is so lucky.

02:04.965 --> 02:07.551
- I'm excited.
- Azumi's a goddess who walks among us!

02:07.634 --> 02:11.346
And she even talks to us lowly introverts
because she's basically a saint!

02:12.639 --> 02:13.473
Excuse me.

02:14.266 --> 02:15.267
- Huh?
- Huh?

02:18.145 --> 02:18.979
Here.

02:20.480 --> 02:21.690
The teacher asked…

02:22.232 --> 02:24.442
If I could make sure to bring this
to you.

02:27.362 --> 02:28.488
Uh, well…

02:29.489 --> 02:30.323
Thank you?

02:34.369 --> 02:36.329
- She's terrifying.
- She's terrifying.

02:36.413 --> 02:37.581
Who was that?

02:37.664 --> 02:40.167
Koyuki Hikawa… aka the Ice Queen.

02:40.667 --> 02:41.668
The Ice Queen?!

02:42.169 --> 02:44.421
She doesn't hang out with any other
students.

02:44.504 --> 02:46.756
That's the first time I've ever talked to
her.

02:46.840 --> 02:49.718
- But it's almost the third trimester.
- It's not my fault.

02:49.801 --> 02:52.304
She gives off these prickly "back off"
vibes, so I just kept my distance.

02:52.387 --> 02:53.346
Chick's scary, man.

02:57.934 --> 03:00.937
Whenever Miki invites people to stuff,
everyone wants to come!

03:01.021 --> 03:03.523
- Oh my gosh, stop!
- 'Cause she's the idol of class five!

03:03.607 --> 03:04.441
Stop!

03:04.524 --> 03:07.485
Look, come on, you guys, stop acting
like I'm some kind of…

03:33.762 --> 03:34.971
It's already winter.

03:36.389 --> 03:38.767
Which means the second trimester's
almost over.

03:39.601 --> 03:42.437
One more to go before my first year
of high school ends.

03:43.980 --> 03:44.940
Without…

03:45.982 --> 03:47.484
Anything really happening.

03:51.112 --> 03:54.199
Well… I guess it's better than middle
school at least.

03:55.158 --> 03:55.992
Oh…

03:56.868 --> 03:57.702
Hmmm.

03:59.454 --> 04:03.541
For the most part I don't care how people
see me anymore, but it kinda bothers me

04:03.625 --> 04:05.835
when they look at me like that.

04:06.878 --> 04:09.381
I don't get it.
What on earth's so scary about me?

04:10.382 --> 04:11.216
My face?

04:13.843 --> 04:15.178
Should I smile more?

04:15.262 --> 04:16.471
SQUISH

04:23.144 --> 04:23.979
Whoa!

04:26.856 --> 04:27.691
Oh…

04:28.233 --> 04:29.109
Sorry, sorry!

04:29.901 --> 04:32.153
I was just curious what you were doin'
there.

04:32.988 --> 04:34.572
Minato, what's going on?

04:34.656 --> 04:36.199
Oh. Yota! What's up?

04:36.283 --> 04:38.076
Huh? Hey, what're you doing?

04:38.159 --> 04:39.202
Are you bullying her?

04:39.286 --> 04:41.037
That's so not cool, man, c'mon!

04:41.121 --> 04:42.080
Who, me? Please.

04:42.580 --> 04:43.665
Are you okay?

04:43.748 --> 04:44.874
Let me help you up.

04:46.126 --> 04:47.419
Oh, uh… thanks.

04:48.169 --> 04:49.004
I mean…

04:53.591 --> 04:54.467
So tall!

04:55.051 --> 04:56.594
152 cm, 176 cm, 189 cm

04:56.678 --> 04:59.723
Sorry about my friend here. You can't
take him anywhere.

04:59.806 --> 05:02.600
What're you apologizing for? I didn't
do anything.

05:02.684 --> 05:04.060
Is he telling the truth?

05:04.144 --> 05:06.354
Seriously, what kinda guy do you
think I am?

05:07.314 --> 05:08.940
Y'always seemed cool to me, Hikawa.

05:09.024 --> 05:10.191
We never had problems.

05:10.734 --> 05:13.194
Aside from making weird faces, you're
pretty chill.

05:13.278 --> 05:15.864
- What?
- Sorry again about scaring you there.

05:17.741 --> 05:19.159
Well. See ya.

05:27.334 --> 05:29.085
How did he know my name?

05:29.878 --> 05:30.754
More importantly…

05:31.713 --> 05:32.547
Who was that?

07:08.935 --> 07:11.855
I saw this on the stream yesterday.
Did you know it's going like super viral

07:11.938 --> 07:12.814
right now?

07:12.897 --> 07:14.524
Whoa. Really? I didn't know that.

07:14.607 --> 07:16.151
- Someone's sitting in my seat.
- Where do they sell it?

07:16.234 --> 07:17.485
At convenience stores, mostly.

07:17.569 --> 07:18.987
Which is less effort?

07:19.070 --> 07:20.655
THE EFFORT TO SPEAK UP

07:21.823 --> 07:23.032
Yeah… I'll just wait.

07:31.082 --> 07:32.876
Oh my gosh! Am I sitting in your seat?!

07:32.959 --> 07:33.793
I'm so sorry!

07:33.877 --> 07:35.545
GRADE 1 CLASS 2

07:35.628 --> 07:36.880
Uh… no, it's fine.

07:39.132 --> 07:40.133
Awkward…

07:44.012 --> 07:46.139
I- I'm really sorry about that, Hikawa.

07:46.222 --> 07:47.390
Huh?

07:48.725 --> 07:49.684
What for?

07:53.188 --> 07:55.690
I'm confused.
Did something merit an apology?

08:05.366 --> 08:06.784
Koyun, did you leave yet?

08:08.870 --> 08:10.622
Not yet. I'm still at the entrance.

08:11.623 --> 08:13.875
I don't have work today. Let's walk home
together!

08:13.958 --> 08:14.792
Woohoo!

08:15.752 --> 08:17.420
Okey-doke. I'll be at my locker.

08:17.921 --> 08:19.047
Be right there.

08:20.089 --> 08:22.175
Ten… nine… eight…

08:22.675 --> 08:23.510
What? A countdown?!

08:23.593 --> 08:24.511
Seven.

08:24.594 --> 08:25.512
Wait, hold on!

08:32.310 --> 08:35.146
Six, five, four, three…

08:36.439 --> 08:37.273
Two…

08:37.774 --> 08:39.567
- One.
- Koyun!

08:49.536 --> 08:50.370
Safe!

08:55.667 --> 08:56.876
Hey! What's so funny?

08:56.960 --> 08:57.835
What is it?

08:57.919 --> 09:00.421
I just didn't think you'd take
it seriously.

09:00.505 --> 09:02.757
That is probably my quickest time
on record!

09:02.840 --> 09:04.092
Pretty impressive, huh?

09:06.302 --> 09:08.471
You can be such a goofball, Miki.

09:10.682 --> 09:12.141
Can I hang out at your place?

09:12.892 --> 09:14.769
Sure, my mom's not home anyway.

09:15.311 --> 09:18.523
Oh, and by the way, you know you
ignored me in the hallway yesterday,

09:18.606 --> 09:19.440
right?

09:19.524 --> 09:20.358
BLANK STARE

09:20.441 --> 09:23.278
Because I didn't have anything to
say to you at the time.

09:23.361 --> 09:25.196
- Uh…
- You could've at least said hi!

09:25.738 --> 09:26.948
Isn't Miki amazing?

09:27.448 --> 09:28.491
What social skills!

09:28.575 --> 09:30.618
She can even connect with the Ice Queen.

09:35.498 --> 09:37.542
Look, they're all good people, and…

09:38.042 --> 09:39.877
I like them, I do, but…

09:40.587 --> 09:41.879
I just don't get it!

09:41.963 --> 09:44.048
They put me up on this weird pedestal.

09:44.799 --> 09:47.677
It's like everyone thinks I walk on
water or something!

09:48.344 --> 09:50.054
Why? I don't get it!

09:50.555 --> 09:53.766
I'd rather go back to being treated
like a gorilla, like before.

09:53.850 --> 09:56.144
Insult me, or call me names! Anything!

09:56.853 --> 09:58.813
I wanna be silly and goof around.

09:58.896 --> 10:02.025
I just really don't wanna play
Little Miss Perfect anymore!

10:02.108 --> 10:03.693
I wanna make people laugh.

10:04.277 --> 10:05.278
As the real me!

10:06.988 --> 10:10.575
Then why don't you just start acting like
yourself around our classmates?

10:10.658 --> 10:12.243
Instead of this persona.

10:12.744 --> 10:15.705
I'm not trying to put on the whole sweet
act on purpose.

10:16.247 --> 10:17.498
Ahh, I don't know.

10:17.582 --> 10:21.127
Whenever I try to be my real self,
for some reason, it just doesn't

10:21.210 --> 10:22.045
come out.

10:22.712 --> 10:25.381
At school, I automatically switch to
that mode.

10:29.761 --> 10:30.595
Maybe…

10:31.929 --> 10:34.223
Maybe I don't even know who the real me
is.

10:34.724 --> 10:37.060
Or what my real feelings even are.

10:41.731 --> 10:42.565
Mi-

10:42.649 --> 10:44.525
BANG

10:44.609 --> 10:46.444
- …ki?
- Ugh, oh my gosh!

10:46.944 --> 10:48.696
Just snap out of it, Miki!

10:48.780 --> 10:50.740
I'm being such a sappy, emo drama queen.

10:50.823 --> 10:52.825
I promise I won't let it happen again!

10:54.369 --> 10:55.828
You'll be just fine.

10:56.746 --> 11:00.333
Whether you're an idol or a gorilla,
your true friends will always stay

11:00.416 --> 11:01.250
by your side.

11:02.126 --> 11:05.463
Those who weren't there for the right
reasons might lose interest,

11:05.546 --> 11:06.964
but who cares about them?

11:07.048 --> 11:07.965
Koyun…

11:08.466 --> 11:09.425
If it were me…

11:10.635 --> 11:14.931
I'd honestly rather be all by myself…
than keep fake friends around.

11:15.640 --> 11:16.474
What?

11:16.557 --> 11:19.268
If I didn't talk to anyone all day I'd
literally die!

11:19.769 --> 11:21.562
Dunno about literally, but sure.

11:22.313 --> 11:25.942
I really wish I had the strength to enjoy
being alone as much as you do.

11:26.901 --> 11:28.569
Well, I dunno about all that.

11:28.653 --> 11:30.530
I'm not saying my way's right either.

11:31.406 --> 11:34.659
Always taking others' feelings into
account is really admirable.

11:37.286 --> 11:39.455
But if it's too much for you, you
can stop.

11:45.461 --> 11:47.088
THE WAY YOU SEE YOURSELF

11:50.508 --> 11:53.386
Ugh, I can't think about this kinda
stuff right now!

11:53.469 --> 11:55.888
Alright. Let's go back to studying for
the test.

11:57.181 --> 11:58.141
Sounds like a plan.

11:58.224 --> 12:00.852
Sweet, now go ahead and tell me
everything that'll be on the

12:00.935 --> 12:02.603
- English exam.
- English!

12:02.687 --> 12:03.521
Seriously?

12:12.029 --> 12:15.032
I love the quiet of the classroom before
everyone gets here.

12:15.825 --> 12:17.618
Now where's my vocabulary book…

12:18.619 --> 12:19.454
Hm?

12:20.997 --> 12:22.623
This is Miki's.

12:24.917 --> 12:27.628
She must've left it after our
study session yesterday.

12:28.629 --> 12:31.591
I imagine she'll need it, so I should
bring it back to her.

12:32.800 --> 12:36.179
Miki probably isn't here yet,
so guess I'll just put it in her desk

12:36.262 --> 12:37.096
drawer for now.

12:40.475 --> 12:41.309
Huh?

12:49.484 --> 12:50.318
Whoa!

12:58.951 --> 12:59.827
Gotcha.

13:01.037 --> 13:03.206
That was terrifying.

13:04.040 --> 13:04.874
Are you okay?

13:06.417 --> 13:08.002
Oh, the guy from the other day.

13:08.085 --> 13:08.920
- Huh?
- Uh-huh?

13:09.003 --> 13:09.837
Wait…

13:11.047 --> 13:12.632
Huh? W-What is it?

13:12.715 --> 13:13.925
Ooh, no, no, no.

13:14.592 --> 13:15.593
What is…

13:16.719 --> 13:18.221
What's going on here?

13:20.807 --> 13:21.682
Go on, Koyuki.

13:22.183 --> 13:23.768
Feed Mr. Giraffe.

13:31.943 --> 13:32.777
Ohhh!

13:34.695 --> 13:36.113
The girl from the other day!

13:36.739 --> 13:38.157
Um. I am.

13:38.241 --> 13:41.619
I'm not wearing my contacts today,
so I didn't recognize you.

13:41.702 --> 13:43.538
Sorry for bumping into you.

13:43.621 --> 13:44.664
Are you okay?

13:48.084 --> 13:50.294
Uh, I just had a flashback.

13:51.504 --> 13:52.338
Oh, wait.

13:54.340 --> 13:55.174
Hmm.

13:55.758 --> 13:57.260
Are you friends with Miki?

13:57.802 --> 13:58.928
Uh. Yeah.

14:00.346 --> 14:01.180
He knows Miki?

14:02.181 --> 14:03.558
Are you in class 5, Sir?

14:04.058 --> 14:07.270
No, I'm in class six actually.
Was just coming to get a textbook I

14:07.353 --> 14:08.187
WHY ARE YOU USING HONORIFICS?

14:08.271 --> 14:10.398
lent to my friend in class five.

14:11.065 --> 14:12.942
- Here you go.
- Thank you.

14:13.442 --> 14:16.112
I came to give this back to her since she
forgot it.

14:17.864 --> 14:18.698
Oh.

14:19.448 --> 14:20.908
W- Where is her desk?

14:21.784 --> 14:22.743
Seriously?

14:24.662 --> 14:25.496
I think, uh…

14:25.580 --> 14:27.915
- This is probably it.
- Probably?

14:27.999 --> 14:28.875
I'm messing with you.

14:28.958 --> 14:29.792
This is it.

14:29.876 --> 14:32.211
Hey, you wanna scribble something on
her desk?

14:32.962 --> 14:34.714
Like "don't forget this next time."

14:35.256 --> 14:36.090
No.

14:36.173 --> 14:37.341
I'll just text her.

14:37.842 --> 14:39.969
Yeah, but who wants to be all mature?

14:40.052 --> 14:42.680
I prefer writing little notes for
my friends.

14:42.763 --> 14:44.974
Like "I got my textbook back."

14:47.727 --> 14:50.187
He seems… pretty laid back.

14:51.188 --> 14:52.023
See you later.

14:52.607 --> 14:54.108
I really appreciate your help.

14:54.817 --> 14:56.819
Let's both crush our final exams.

14:56.903 --> 14:58.154
Uh, what was it?

14:58.237 --> 14:59.530
Let's see, um…

15:00.656 --> 15:02.575
- Himuro!
- Oh. Um.

15:03.075 --> 15:05.286
My name isn't Himuro, though…

15:05.369 --> 15:06.537
It's Hikawa.

15:07.204 --> 15:08.581
Oh, well. It's okay.

15:09.123 --> 15:10.917
He just met me so that makes sense.

15:23.679 --> 15:25.848
So peaceful… and quiet.

15:26.682 --> 15:27.642
Just how I like it.

15:31.687 --> 15:34.190
- A huge coffee stain right in the
- Guys always hang out in groups.

15:34.273 --> 15:35.107
Middle of his shirt. So I try to tell

15:35.191 --> 15:37.318
- him, right? But he's all like
- Depends on the guy, I guess.

15:37.401 --> 15:38.736
"Concentrate, Mr. Hayato!"

15:38.819 --> 15:40.071
- And I'm like, dude…
- Hm?

15:40.154 --> 15:40.988
I recognize him.

15:41.072 --> 15:43.407
He was with the guy who looked like a
giraffe.

15:45.201 --> 15:46.118
He's in my grade.

15:46.202 --> 15:48.204
There's three grades at my school.

15:49.497 --> 15:52.375
I never paid much attention to my
surroundings before.

15:52.917 --> 15:55.378
Didn't know who my classmates were.

15:55.461 --> 15:57.964
- Eventually, I was just like fine
- Or anything about them, really.

15:58.047 --> 16:00.675
Whatever, and let him keep
walking around like that.

16:02.969 --> 16:03.803
Oops.

16:04.428 --> 16:07.139
Our eyes met. I think. Maybe.

16:10.601 --> 16:13.896
I just quickly looked away like an
awkward weirdo.

16:14.522 --> 16:17.316
Then again, I barely know him, so why
would I say hi?

16:20.361 --> 16:21.362
Eh, it's fine.

16:22.363 --> 16:24.740
Let's see. We've got milk tea…

16:25.616 --> 16:27.201
Oh, cocoa sounds good too.

16:27.284 --> 16:28.869
MADE WITH 8 AUTHENTIC SPICES

16:29.620 --> 16:30.454
What's up?

16:32.832 --> 16:34.417
Why'd you ignore me back there?

16:35.584 --> 16:38.879
- Oh, I did?
- Yeah, I waved at you, and you ran away.

16:39.839 --> 16:41.549
Huh? You waved?

16:42.049 --> 16:43.092
I can't believe it!

16:43.175 --> 16:45.052
Ah! Uh, I'm- I'm sorry.

16:45.636 --> 16:46.470
Am I though?

16:46.971 --> 16:49.682
Uh, I honestly just didn't notice you
had waved.

16:49.765 --> 16:51.517
I swear I didn't mean anything by it.

16:51.600 --> 16:53.728
I know. Just messin' with ya.

16:53.811 --> 16:55.563
- Huh?
- Your drink.

16:56.313 --> 16:57.148
Oh, yeah.

16:58.149 --> 17:00.735
BIMMY AUTHENTIC CURRY DRINK
EIGHT KINDS OF SPICES

17:00.818 --> 17:02.445
What's that? You like that stuff?

17:02.528 --> 17:04.655
No, I just pressed the button by mistake.

17:05.364 --> 17:06.907
Oh, man, that was my fault.

17:06.991 --> 17:09.368
- I'm so sorry.
- This guy…

17:10.202 --> 17:12.288
He doesn't seem like a bad person.

17:13.622 --> 17:17.001
But his way of keeping people at
arms length is different from mine.

17:17.084 --> 17:17.918
Hiya!

17:18.878 --> 17:22.673
So I can't help but keep my guard up
and feel wary.

17:23.632 --> 17:25.760
I can't tell… who you really are.

17:27.261 --> 17:28.095
Hey!

17:29.221 --> 17:30.931
Whatcha gettin' into, Amamiya?

17:31.724 --> 17:32.600
Amamiya?

17:32.683 --> 17:33.684
Hm?

17:33.768 --> 17:35.644
Right, I never introduced myself.

17:35.728 --> 17:38.689
Name's Amamiya.
Nice to officially meet you.

17:39.190 --> 17:42.276
- Uh, hi.
- Wait, why're you introducing yourself?

17:42.359 --> 17:43.402
You hitting on her?

17:43.486 --> 17:45.112
Wait, whoa, what's going on?

17:46.489 --> 17:49.700
I know he seems all cute and cuddly but
be warned, alright?

17:49.784 --> 17:52.036
You better keep an eye out with this one.

17:52.119 --> 17:53.245
Nah, I'm just playin'!

17:54.288 --> 17:56.248
Okay, knock it off. For real.

17:56.332 --> 17:57.416
- Uh…
- Get lost, dude.

17:57.500 --> 17:59.085
- No, thanks.
- I'm uncomfortable.

17:59.168 --> 18:00.169
Jeez…

18:00.711 --> 18:03.214
And I really, really don't like it.

18:04.298 --> 18:06.759
Huh? Uh, what's going on? You good?

18:06.842 --> 18:07.676
Hm.

18:09.220 --> 18:10.763
STRETCH

18:11.263 --> 18:12.306
What?

18:12.389 --> 18:13.307
What is happening?

18:14.308 --> 18:16.227
Oh. Wait, I think…

18:16.727 --> 18:18.187
He's teasing me.

18:18.938 --> 18:19.980
MIND THEATER
THE CORRECT WAY TO RESPOND WHEN TEASED

18:20.064 --> 18:22.149
Okay, so what's the right way to respond?

18:23.067 --> 18:24.193
One: Get angry.

18:24.276 --> 18:25.694
Rah, I'm so angry!

18:26.195 --> 18:27.446
Two: Act shy.

18:27.530 --> 18:29.365
Oh, my gosh, would you stop?

18:30.533 --> 18:31.659
Three: Laugh.

18:31.742 --> 18:32.993
You're so funny.

18:34.537 --> 18:35.496
It's probably best…

18:40.042 --> 18:41.252
To just smile.

18:41.752 --> 18:43.087
Option three: Laugh.

18:43.170 --> 18:44.004
Hahaha.

18:52.096 --> 18:53.389
Man, is she prickly.

18:53.973 --> 18:57.601
Or was she just like that 'cause
she was mad at me because I interrupted

18:57.685 --> 18:58.602
your conversation?!

18:58.686 --> 19:00.020
No, probably not.

19:03.315 --> 19:04.567
If I were to guess…

19:05.693 --> 19:08.028
That was… her wall?

19:18.247 --> 19:19.331
Hey, help her out, Amano!

19:19.415 --> 19:21.625
Let shorty here borrow some of your
height!

19:21.709 --> 19:22.877
Yeah, yeah…

19:24.753 --> 19:26.505
Yo, 'sup, Little Yuki!

19:32.678 --> 19:34.096
Tell me the truth, Koyuki.

19:34.180 --> 19:35.514
Are you into Igarashi?

19:42.229 --> 19:43.731
I mean, did you see that?

19:44.398 --> 19:45.524
That was so funny!

19:46.358 --> 19:47.193
I died!

19:51.739 --> 19:53.324
I'm sorry, Koyuki.

20:04.710 --> 20:06.962
I'm warning you, don't try it.

21:57.197 --> 21:58.032
Hm?

21:58.824 --> 22:00.492
Koyun, I'm sorry!

22:00.576 --> 22:02.911
Homeroom is literally never gonna end!

22:03.912 --> 22:06.623
You can just head to the community center
without me.

22:06.707 --> 22:07.875
Great.

22:09.251 --> 22:10.669
- Hey. Hey, hey! Why are you all
- Ugh.

22:10.753 --> 22:11.837
By yourself, huh?

22:11.920 --> 22:12.838
I'm not.

22:12.921 --> 22:14.006
Could've fooled me!

22:14.089 --> 22:15.382
I don't see anyone else.

22:15.466 --> 22:18.302
- Yeah, where are they then?
- Why is it always like this?

22:18.385 --> 22:20.220
- Is it an imaginary friend?
- Why me?

22:20.763 --> 22:22.973
Why do I still get bullied and
harassed even after school?

22:23.057 --> 22:24.600
She can exorcise my demons!

22:24.683 --> 22:25.768
Yo, wait up!

22:27.478 --> 22:29.104
Hey, we're just tryna help you out here!

22:29.188 --> 22:30.356
We're really nice guys.

22:31.273 --> 22:33.233
I dunno, speak for yourself, man.

22:34.651 --> 22:37.363
- I mean, I'm just sayin…!
- I really hate this feeling.

22:40.032 --> 22:41.408
It's the absolute worst.

22:42.493 --> 22:44.411
- No, but seriously you can trust us.
- This is bad.

22:44.495 --> 22:46.330
Yeah, like I said, we're nice guys. Don't
worry.

22:46.413 --> 22:47.247
I have to run.

22:54.630 --> 22:55.506
FREEZE

22:56.131 --> 22:57.383
I don't know his name.

22:57.466 --> 22:59.093
GONG

22:59.176 --> 23:01.470
- Uh, is she broken?
- Uh.

23:01.553 --> 23:02.388
Um…

23:02.471 --> 23:03.305
THINKING

23:03.389 --> 23:04.807
- Help!
- What's your problem?

23:05.474 --> 23:06.308
You know him?

23:07.434 --> 23:09.478
- Hm?
- Oh! He saw!

23:09.561 --> 23:10.396
STARE

23:10.479 --> 23:11.313
Hm? Hmmm?

23:11.980 --> 23:13.148
Put your contacts in!

23:16.735 --> 23:17.861
And… he's gone.

23:18.362 --> 23:21.573
- Dude, he totally blew you off!
- Ouch, he ignored you so hard. Jeez!

23:21.657 --> 23:24.326
- Now come on, let's go have some fun.
- I'm not going!

23:25.244 --> 23:26.662
Oh, what should I do?

23:26.745 --> 23:29.164
TWO PEOPLE AGAINST ONE
WHAT IF I MAKE THEM MAD IN A BAD WAY?

23:29.248 --> 23:30.124
And frustrated.

23:30.624 --> 23:32.292
- Come on.
- And pissed off!

23:32.376 --> 23:34.378
- Let's go. Let's go. Let's go!
- It'll be super fun!

23:34.461 --> 23:36.213
I told you… I'm not going anywhere!

23:36.296 --> 23:38.424
- Yeah, trust us!
- Just leave me alone.

23:38.924 --> 23:40.134
Seriously.

23:43.137 --> 23:43.971
Bye.

23:46.932 --> 23:48.142
Sorry. Are you okay?

23:48.976 --> 23:51.645
Oh! I knew it. It was you!

23:52.896 --> 23:54.106
Mister Giraffe.
